      "text": "Caches frequent catalog reads for lower latency\nand fewer MongoDB reads. On a miss, the API reads\nMongoDB, then fills Redis. Use TTL + invalidation.",
      "originalText": "Caches frequent catalog reads for lower latency\nand fewer MongoDB reads. On a miss, the API reads\nMongoDB, then fills Redis. Use TTL + invalidation.",
